### PAGINATION EXAMPLES

### Get First Page (20 results)
GET {{baseUrl}}/subCategories/getAllSubCategories?limit=20&page=0

### Get Second Page
GET {{baseUrl}}/subCategories/getAllSubCategories?limit=20&page=1

### Get With Custom Limit
GET {{baseUrl}}/subCategories/getAllSubCategories?limit=10&page=0

### Get Category Sub-Categories with Pagination
GET {{baseUrl}}/subCategories/getSubCategoriesByCategory/1?limit=10&page=0

### INACTIVE SUB-CATEGORIES

### Create Inactive Sub-Category
POST {{baseUrl}}/subCategories/createSubCategory
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Discontinued",
  "categoryId": 1,
  "isActive": false
}

### Deactivate Sub-Category
PUT {{baseUrl}}/subCategories/updateSubCategory/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "isActive": false
}

### Reactivate Sub-Category
PUT {{baseUrl}}/subCategories/updateSubCategory/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "isActive": true
}
